Spec: Follow coverage

Purpose:
  Share of a route that a follow covered, stored with a linked ride.

Owns:
  ./follow_coverage.dart
  /test/domain/follow_coverage_test.dart

References:
  /docs/specs/history/20-followed-rides.md

Must:
  Coverage is the union of the ridden intervals clipped to the route, divided by its length, from `0` to `1`.
  Parts ridden twice count once.
  A route without length has coverage `0`.
